> I was still level 15, I died twice in Orcus Lair, at the time of my
> final death I was Level 11 with 65 HP max, I genocided all V's but I
> guess I still need something to protect against Level drain.

Your Max HP loss was probably due to not having Fire resistance.
_Apparently_, without fire resistance the firetraps reduce your max
HP.I wouldnt know as I always manage to get it (its one of the easiest
intrisics to get, unless you're a vampire).
NEVER go to Gehennom without Fire resistance (you are going into hell,
after all).
As for Level drain, either wield Excalibur (easy-to-get decent
artifact weapon) which stops level drain completely, OR get Magic
resistance (this is another _essential_ intrinsic). MR (magic
resistance) will stop level drain _most_ of the time.
Basically you arent prepared for hell yet, Dont go to hell without
fire and magic resistance. If you dont know how to get those
intrinsics, check the spoilers (or ask the Oracle?).

P.S.
You say you have died twice in Orcus' lair, Did Orcus kill you with
his Wand of death?
If so, reflection is _another_ essential intrinsic...

Google about for 'Ascension Kit', you need some of it before you
should go too far into Hell/Gehennom.

